{"index": 46, "skill": "water-quality", "level": "L2", "question": "帮我分析一下最近一个月瘦西湖水质变化趋势。", "expected_sql": "SELECT ROUND(AVG(d.dox), 2) AS '平均溶解氧(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MIN(d.dox), 2) AS '最低溶解氧(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MAX(d.dox), 2) AS '最高溶解氧(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(AVG(d.codmn), 2) AS '平均CODMn(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MIN(d.codmn), 2) AS '最低CODMn(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MAX(d.codmn), 2) AS '最高CODMn(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(AVG(d.nh3n), 3) AS '平均氨氮(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MIN(d.nh3n), 3) AS '最低氨氮(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(MAX(d.nh3n), 3) AS '最高氨氮(mg/L)',\n       ROUND(AVG(d.tp), 3) AS '平均总磷(mg/L)'\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d d\nJOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b b ON d.stcd = b.stcd\nWHERE b.stnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%' AND b.sttp = 'WQ'\n  AND d.spt >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\n  AND d.spt <= NOW();", "final_answer": "## 瘦西湖水质变化趋势分析 (2026年7月)\n\n已完成分析，以下是核心发现：\n\n### 总体评价\n7月瘦西湖水质整体保持 **Ⅲ类** 水平，水质状况稳定，未出现明显恶化或突发性污染。\n\n### 关键指标\n\n| 指标 | 月均值 | 波动范围 | 评定 |\n|------|--------|----------|------|\n| 溶解氧 DO | 4.02 mg/L | 3.90～4.10 | ⚠️ 接近Ⅳ类临界 |\n| CODMn | 2.90 mg/L | 2.80～3.00 | ✅ Ⅲ类 |\n| 氨氮 NH3-N | 0.580 mg/L | 0.560～0.590 | ✅ Ⅲ类 |\n| 总磷 TP | 0.110 mg/L | 恒定不变 | ✅ Ⅲ类 |\n| pH | 7.75 | 7.58～7.98 | ✅ Ⅲ类 |\n| 水温 | 22.23°C | 21.60～22.80 | 正常 |\n\n### 主要发现\n1. **溶解氧是短板** — 均值 4.02 mg/L 低于Ⅲ类标准下限 5 mg/L，是制约水质等级提升的关键因素，夏季高温导致溶氧能力下降。\n2. **总磷控制最优** — 全月恒定 0.110 mg/L，零波动，管控措施非常有效。\n3. **其他指标稳定** — CODMn、氨氮、pH均在Ⅲ类标准范围内窄幅波动。\n\n### 建议\n- 高温期启动人工增氧设备，提升溶解氧水平\n- 加密溶解氧监测频次，特别是高温天气时段\n- 持续控制周边污染源输入\n\n已输出完整分析报告和两张趋势图表，请查看。", "actual_sqls": ["SELECT stcd, stnm, rvnm, sttp, addvcd FROM sl323.st_stbprp_b WHERE sttp='WQ' AND (stnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%' OR rvnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%')", "SELECT stcd, stnm, rvnm, sttp, addvcd FROM sl323.st_stbprp_b WHERE sttp='WQ' AND (stnm LIKE '%西湖%' OR rvnm LIKE '%西湖%')", "SELECT COLUMN_NAME, DATA_TYPE, IS_NULLABLE, COLUMN_KEY FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS WHERE TABLE_SCHEMA='sl325' AND TABLE_NAME='wq_pcp_d'", "SELECT MIN(spt) AS min_spt, MAX(spt) AS max_spt FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d WHERE stcd='HT0051003052000022'", "SELECT\n  DATE(spt) AS dt,\n  COUNT(*) AS sample_cnt,\n  ROUND(AVG(dox), 2) AS avg_dox,\n  ROUND(MIN(dox), 2) AS min_dox,\n  ROUND(MAX(dox), 2) AS max_dox,\n  ROUND(AVG(codmn), 2) AS avg_codmn,\n  ROUND(MIN(codmn), 2) AS min_codmn,\n  ROUND(MAX(codmn), 2) AS max_codmn,\n  ROUND(AVG(nh3n), 3) AS avg_nh3n,\n  ROUND(MIN(nh3n), 3) AS min_nh3n,\n  ROUND(MAX(nh3n), 3) AS max_nh3n,\n  ROUND(AVG(tp), 3) AS avg_tp,\n  ROUND(MIN(tp), 3) AS min_tp,\n  ROUND(MAX(tp), 3) AS max_tp,\n  ROUND(AVG(ph), 2) AS avg_ph,\n  ROUND(AVG(turb), 2) AS avg_turb,\n  ROUND(AVG(wtmp), 2) AS avg_wtmp\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d\nWHERE stcd='HT0051003052000022'\n  AND spt >= '2026-07-01' AND spt < '2026-08-01'\nGROUP BY DATE(spt)\nORDER BY dt", "SELECT\n  WEEK(spt, 1) AS wk,\n  MIN(DATE(spt)) AS wk_start,\n  MAX(DATE(spt)) AS wk_end,\n  ROUND(AVG(dox), 2) AS avg_dox,\n  ROUND(AVG(codmn), 2) AS avg_codmn,\n  ROUND(AVG(nh3n), 3) AS avg_nh3n,\n  ROUND(AVG(tp), 3) AS avg_tp,\n  ROUND(AVG(ph), 2) AS avg_ph,\n  ROUND(AVG(turb), 2) AS avg_turb,\n  ROUND(AVG(wtmp), 2) AS avg_wtmp\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d\nWHERE stcd='HT0051003052000022'\n  AND spt >= '2026-07-01' AND spt < '2026-08-01'\nGROUP BY WEEK(spt, 1)\nORDER BY wk"], "tool_trace": ["read_file", "read_file", "read_file", "read_file", "ls", "ls", "water-db_get_table_schema", "water-db_get_table_schema", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "read_file", "ls", "read_file", "bash", "bash", "read_file", "bash", "bash", "write_file", "present_files"], "tool_results": ["Schema of `st_stbprp_b`:\n  stcd  char(18)  NOT NULL  PRI  \n  stnm  char(30)  NULL    \n  rvnm  char(30)  NULL    \n  hnnm  char(30)  NULL    \n  bsnm  char(30)  NULL    \n  lgtd  decimal(10,6)  NULL    \n  lttd  decimal(10,6)  NULL    \n  stlc  char(50)  NULL    \n  addvcd  char(6)  NULL    \n  dtmnm  char(16)  NULL    \n  dtmel  decimal(7,3)  NULL    \n  dtpr  decimal(7,3)  NULL    \n  sttp 